{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimum Link is a lucid dreaming sandbox. Enter a world to start playing with it, spawning things into it, and the dream just might respond with things of its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 dream-like worlds to explore as your sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single player, or invite a friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Avatar customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spawn things into the sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adjust scale of things</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Telekinesis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Laser guns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spray paint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fish people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Photo mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mouse and keyboard input method highly recommended.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>100% human-made. No AI was used in programming or asset generation for this product.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/941120?t=1773246674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941120/393bd0350c2a92189c4f5727fe561a7c5025e210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773246674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941120/54352831baac22d36b9d938ff065a1bb62280146/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773246674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/941120/54352831baac22d36b9d938ff065a1bb62280146/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773246674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"det